  "summary": "Nick Xenophon Team senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore announced her resignation from the Australian Senate after discovering she holds dual British citizenship through her mother. Her mother was born in Singapore when it was a British colony, which granted her British citizenship that was passed to Kakoschke-Moore by descent. This discovery was unexpected as her family had previously received advice that she was not eligible for British citizenship. Kakoschke-Moore expressed being heartbroken by the situation and will request the matter be referred to the high court to determine how her vacancy will be filled. She intends to continue with the NXT party and hopes to return to the Senate. Party leader Nick Xenophon expressed devastation at losing her but believes her political career is not over. There is uncertainty about whether a recount of the 2016 Senate election will fill the position, with the party citing recent high court precedents as creating legal uncertainty."
}
```

